OL,3,GNEWSAReform accuses departing
OL,4,Acouncillors of 'betrayal'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree councillors who have resigned
OL,7,Ffrom Reform UK have "conned " voters
OL,8,Fand "betrayed" those who helped get
OL,9,Fthem elected, the party has said.
OL,11,FLyndsey Fox, Nicole Brown and Paul
OL,12,FSexton have had their party affiliation
OL,13,Fchanged to independent on the Durham
OL,14,FCounty Council website, although none
OL,15,Fhas given precise reasons for their
OL,16,Fshift.
OL,18,FIt leaves Reform with a small majority,
OL,19,Fwith 51 councillors, on an authority
OL,20,Fthe party emphatically won control of
OL,21,Fwhen grabbing 65 seats at last year's
OL,22,Felection.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
