OL,3,GNEWSAReform accuses departing
OL,4,Acouncillors of 'betrayal'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Andrew Husband told the
OL,7,FBBC the three former members "have let
OL,8,Ftheir residents down" but he offered no
OL,9,Fexplanation for their departures.
